  (text "Net names: COLn = matrix column n, LROWn = lamp row n, SROWn = switch row n (pidp8i gpio-common.c)." (at 25.40 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1d8c05ed-0953-4eaa-b2bb-1a51ef6f57ff))
  (text "GPIO choice is in pidp8-panel/board_map.h. GP28 is grounded so the firmware knows it is on this board." (at 25.40 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a155f520-99f4-4caf-aebf-a78752eeee97))
  (text "JP1/JP2: bridge C-STD for a standard PiDP-8/I, C-SER for one with the serial-port mod." (at 101.60 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 54898fd2-5b92-480a-a1d3-df6d5c1bc784))
